{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Tycoon game set in the wild west of space.\u00a0 A trading, crafting, and business simulation in space. Build up colonies and set up new mining ventures to extract foreign untapped resources from many celestial bodies. A sandbox game that is procedurally generated with a seed. The player sets up space stations, factories, mining operations, and is also responsible for the transportation of goods and commodities. Explore different planets, suns, and blackholes.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/8d87d8471786add90a774445095ccbe3.avif?t=1759244319\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Suns and Systems per Map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passenger Stations and Passenger Ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraforming Planets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/7b5e55ba8056a4cd6e82d341f942b040.avif?t=1759244319\" width=1000 height=563 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/090bb885717cf2f466d32e03af074485.avif?t=1759244319\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.poster.avif?t=1759244319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.webm?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.mp4?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Factories and Mining Outposts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.poster.avif?t=1759244319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.webm?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.mp4?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and set up mining outposts to transfer resources and products for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Establish Shipping Lanes and Routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.poster.avif?t=1759244319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.webm?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.mp4?t=1759244319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp